    {
        "text": "We're already thirty minutes into the contest, and what's shocking is, not a single team who's picked up some gold has chosen to end it yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't help but see wild, wild ambition in these championship contestants!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Pancho, what's your perspective?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_192_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks to be a fierce championship, this one. One for the ages. Got great expectations for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pancho"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No arguments here, I'm sure all of you in the audience feel just the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Each of our stages will keep following each team's action, so we guarantee you won't miss a single bedazzling fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "And you'd better not relax just yet. We're gonna turn this pressure, this urgency into a force for voting, and give the contestants you love your precious ballot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Once you spend for them, that's when you truly love them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
