    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_201",
        "name2": "avg_npc_204",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk! I thought the whole lover act was a joke! How do they have so much fight?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Irritated Contestant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_202",
        "name2": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Darling, how fortuitous, I almost thought I'd lose you. (Whisper) Can't you come up with a plan of your own?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_202",
        "name2": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ohh, how fearsome they were. (Whisper) My CHARACTER'S a frail girl, huev\u00f3n!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_202",
        "name2": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, it's all okay now. Watch me teach them a lesson! (Whisper) Tch! Start trying, okay, Miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_202",
        "name2": "avg_npc_201",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, my dear, you're the best~ (Whisper) Are you messing with me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Those two have no uncertainty of skill. And military temperaments on top of it. Perhaps they served in the past.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(As for being sweethearts, I presume that's a ploy of sorts, for winning the audience over.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Very aggrandizing, but still a means nonetheless.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Though, still, very aggrandizing.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(If that Swire saw this, I'm sure she'd waste no time gushing how she'd like to play a similar role in such a contest.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(We're better off not letting her find out.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(All in all, this couple has a secure win. Nothing to see there, no gold after a sweep of the area. Time to leave.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Twenty ingots of pure gold. I worry more than a few are in conspicuous places\u2014on top of all the landmarks and such. Those areas will be hotly contested.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nothing really calls for fighting over those ingots.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I should be searching for the ones left behind in hidden corners.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But... if there are ruffians out to cause chaos under this contest, I'm sure they'd at least find blind spots in the cameras and drones before they do their work.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Both need addressing... I ought to bring it up with Hui-chieh first. Tsk, too quick.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Forget it. I have no desire to discuss anything with that juvenile woman anyway. I'll handle things as they come.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
