    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(They've even installed cameras in crevices like this. These can't have been just for the competition.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But even so, the residential housing ought not to have surveillance in it. I'm guessing drones will only film interiors if they capture contestants going in.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(In other words, as long as you're not physically filmed entering, there's a high chance officials won't notice you.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(If you exploit that fact... hm?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
