        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the status?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bombs are all set on our end, Rafaela.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Contestant?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. I'm done here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's move to the next location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, I just got a distress from C-team. Seems like they're really struggling with an opponent there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Contestant?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Ch'en from the LUNG wRATh team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Contestant?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hermano told us not to take on what we can't handle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Move a nearby team to them, don't stand out too much. Give it up if it's a losing battle, don't keep fighting out of obligation. Our actual job takes priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rafaela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_421_laplum_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_205",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Contestant?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
