    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "With her proficiency, it takes little effort to find the bomb Rafaela mentioned.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(...She was being serious.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I never imagined the girl would be one of them.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I imagine, by 'actual job,' they mean more of these bombs, and it sounds as if there are several teams on it.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The officials might have prohibited comms equipment, but all signs indicate they have their own way of keeping in touch, under the radar.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(And there's no knowing if they have a plan B. I'm worried there won't be much meaning in keeping on their trail, and there's the risk of being found.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Two things stood out: 'Bombs', 'Hermano'. They can play into our knowledge. Having these few keywords should be sufficient for now.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...It's about time to rendezvous, too. Perfect chance to see how Hui-chieh's done.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
