    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "20_I04",
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "'Drip-drop.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Somewhere unknown, a loosely shut faucet drips water, the droplets striking the basin, the noise minute. The noise, nevertheless, is like a stone breaking a placid lake's surface."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "text": "In a split-second, the contestants around her all swarm in, and Ch'en takes her opening steps."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
