        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "fadetim": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "Atop a roof, Lin Y\u00fchsia calmly confirms the situation surrounding."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(There she is, playing at the hero again.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(She'll spend eternity without learning to behave. I'm not bothered to help her.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(That said, the commotion's audible enough for some teams in the vicinity to make for here.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...I suppose I'll hold them off. Drawing too many people's attention won't do any good.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Y\u00fchsia loosens her wrists, hops down from the roof, and lands squarely at the alley entrance."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
